training responses. \code{gp_loo_scores()} scores the exact leave-one-out
predictions of \code{\link[=loo_gp]{loo_gp()}} against the same reference.

For latent models (\code{\link[=fit_latent_gp]{fit_latent_gp()}}), \code{gp_holdout_scores()} scores the
predictive distribution of new responses: with a Gaussian likelihood as
above, with a Bernoulli likelihood by \code{\link[=gp_classification_scores]{gp_classification_scores()}}, whose
